      "text": "$t1 == '192'?\r\n`",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44736:44752"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p1",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44752:44754"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你好？”男人问。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44754:44765"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "除了篝火的噼啪声别无他物。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44765:44780"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你好？”他站起身，朝森林走了几步，“有人在那边吗？”\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44780:44809"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你又听到模糊的呼喊声。这声音几乎无法分辨。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44809:44832"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p6",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“你说什么？”拍摄者喊道。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44832:44847"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p7",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "这次你连回答的声音都没有听到。没办法，声音太轻了。你什么也分不清。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44847:44882"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p8",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你失望地退了带。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44882:44892"
    },
    {
      "id": "192:p9",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "转到 186。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:44892:44901"
    }
  ]
}
